00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:50.144 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CAROLINE DESROSIERS,

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:51.412 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Hydro-Québec

00:01:49.176 --> 00:01:52.746 size:53% position:73% line:53%
